#. Description of the plugin
#: elallas-for-woo.php
msgid ""
"Online withdrawal (elállás) button and case management for WooCommerce — "
"compliant with Directive (EU) 2023/2673 and 415/2025. (XII. 23.) Korm. "
"rendelet."
